# Advanced Interactive AI Tools

This implements the user's request to add the Smart Scheduling & Free-Time Finder, and the Interactive Quizzing tools to the AI's capabilities.

## User Review Required
> [!NOTE]
> No new database models are needed. This relies on the new Canvas sync data and existing Timetable data.

## Proposed Changes

### 1. Smart Scheduling & Free-Time Finder
- #### [MODIFY] [ai_tools.py](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py)
  - Create `find_available_slots(duration_minutes: int, before_date: str)`
  - **Logic:** 
      - Parse `before_date` to get the timeframe (from tomorrow up to `before_date`).
      - Query [TimetableSlot](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/models/timetable.py#8-40) (weekly recurring academic events) and [TimetableEvent](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/models/event.py#6-28) (one-off personal/study events) for the user.
      - Restrict working hours to a reasonable window (e.g. 08:00 - 22:00).
      - Scan for open windows of continuous free time >= `duration_minutes`.
      - Return the top 3-5 best time slots (e.g. `["2025-03-08 14:00 - 16:30", ...]`) formatted nicely for the AI.

### 2. Interactive Quizzing
- #### [MODIFY] [ai_tools.py](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py)
  - Create `generate_practice_quiz(course_code: str, topic_or_week: str)`
  - **Logic:**
      - Uses `google.genai` client directly within the tool (similar to [generate_video_subtitles](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py#912-976) or [brief_generator.py](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/brief_generator.py)).
      - First, pulls text from `rag_service` (via [search_module_materials](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/ai_tools.py#308-378)) based on the `topic_or_week`.
      - Calls Gemini via the API to generate a strict JSON payload: `[{"question": "...", "options": ["..."], "correct_answer": "...", "explanation": "..."}]`.
      - Returns the JSON to the main conversational AI, wrapped in instructions: *"Do not reveal the correct answers yet. Ask the user Question 1, wait for their reply, then grade it and ask Question 2."*

### 3. Context & Instructions
- #### [MODIFY] [context_assembler.py](file:///Users/oli/Desktop/CraftCanvas/backend/services/context_assembler.py)
  - Add `find_available_slots` and `generate_practice_quiz` to the AI's system prompt so it knows how and when to use them.

